+both exact programs through the protected Racket bridge. The retained match
+pattern is `[true, true, true, true, false]` across ten Racket evaluations. The
+owner should include K=3/K=4 in a demonstration whenever those regimes may occur
+in a query, or add odd/even and K≤2-gated rivals to lesson selection. This is a
+curriculum proposal, not a production-source change or approval claim.
