+## 2026-10-24 override-contract repair proposal
+
+Reproduced the retained defect on source
+`80778e91f5f85cc0699b251e4d99a11728a576012201c843e018ac20d97e2470`:
+`palette_kind="warm"` was ignored and seed 0 emitted colors `{3,5}`. Version
+2.1.0 makes all four palette branches literal, uses a separate keyed palette RNG,
+records the selected branch through `GenCtx`, and makes helpful `texture` values
+true aliases with conflict and unknown-value rejection.
+
+The adjacent count controls were the same class of defect, so `n_colors` now
+controls the realized distinct-color count; `palette_size` and
+`n_distinct_colors` are validated aliases. Conflicting aliases, booleans,
+unknown axes, and invalid fixed controls fail closed. The repair is covered by 20
+focused tests. The source-bound audit checked 192 palette/band/seed cases, realized
+every legal color in every branch, found no violations, and matched eight
+representative labels against the selected canonical program through protected
+Racket. Owner selection/integration is still required; this return does not mark
+the generator approved or training-safe.
